<p>A reconstruction proposal described in reports as linked to President Trump&#x27;s &quot;Board of Peace&quot; has hit a funding shortfall, slowing plans for Gaza&#x27;s postwar recovery. Of the 10 countries said to have pledged money, only three had actually contributed funds as of the latest reporting. The slowdown underscores how hard it remains to turn donor promises into real rebuilding in Gaza, where wartime destruction has created enormous needs even as financing for postwar plans remains uncertain.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/W5_YMjDdOuK7z84HoZg14tKIJsspqb2uVOySAejWUuPPTRl9m36V0A1VmTsB55CvsxUTDDQy0sXl86opzc6-mFvZEqqxQBnaBKBJc-3Y_55j0NlOMIaXGJa0s5dLe24dn2WI1NV2ouBMMr4wkv1zxA1STgyh3VyEBiEw_XK19DY54n5eEWD3KrJiofY7-F9oTPlfT4rSpyqCWEZZ54y7KkP_GYfyHsiw3bnwwtqD1KP-md2kw_FIXiEIwVcpbCmeFriQ9ZEmPgA3vFnTRQ' alt='Palestinians walk along a street surrounded by buildings destroyed during Israeli air and ground operations in Khan Younis, southern Gaza Strip, Thursday, April 9, 2026. (AP Photo/Abdel Kareem Hana)' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Plan condition: NDTV said the proposal envisions large-scale rebuilding only after Hamas disarms, tying reconstruction to a major political and security threshold</li><li>Regional strain: NDTV reported that the funding squeeze is unfolding amid what it described as the US-Iran war, connecting the slowdown to the wider regional conflict</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-trump-board-of-peace-cash-crunch-gaza-plan/'>Trump’s Board of Peace faces cash crunch, stalling Gaza plan, sources say</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/trumps-peace-board-faces-cash-crunch-stalling-gaza-plan-sources-say'>‘No money’: Trump’s Board of Peace faces cash crunch, stalling Gaza plan, sources say</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/donald-trumps-board-of-peace-faces-cash-crunch-amid-us-iran-war-sta